<title>USA: Amli Residential completes sale of shares.</title>
<headline>Amli Residential completes sale of shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amli Residential Properties Trust said Monday it completed the sale of 2,750,000 common shares for $21.75 each.</p>
<p>The real estate investment trust said net proceeds totaled $56.4 million. There are now than 14.5 million Amli common shares in public hands, Amli said.</p>
<p>Amli's portfolio currently includes 35 apartment communities containing 13,501 apartment homes. The company also has 2,728 apartment homes under development at 10 U.S. locations.</p>
<p>- Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
